R6 (`PkgI2.RaynaudCriterionNF`, `(σ - 1)² = 0` on `A[ℓⁿ]` for every inertia element; from SGA 7 IX 3.5 through the
research field `sga7_IX_3_5_ForwardGeom_Def34`) has three readers on the chain: D2 (TailH's `raynaudPlace_of_R6`,
`tateWildK_of_R6`, `torsFix_of_descent`), A6 (TailI's `modelG3G6_of_leaves3`) and the kernel field (TailC's
`good_of_QML3`). On the manuscript's route these need `D2A6.R6U` = `SZRaynaud.RaynaudWildNF` (L814-818) ∧
